	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "PLTS MONITORING CONTROLLER — 00_TOP\nIntegrated 48 V LiFePO4 Monitoring Controller (15S, 45-54 V, 100 A shunt path)\nHierarki 12 sheet per §45 brief. 2-layer FR-4 1,6 mm, 2 oz, target board 130 x 90 mm.\nDokumen otoritatif: (1) PCB Design Master Brief v1.1; (2) PLTS_PCB_01_AUDIT_REPORT_v1.0;\n(3) PLTS_PCB_02_KICAD_AGENT_TASK_SPEC_v1.0. Prioritas §61: keselamatan > integritas Kelvin >\nrobustness 54 V > keandalan ESP32 > EMI > komunikasi > termal > servisabilitas > ukuran/biaya.\nPrioritas absolut: pin map §2 TIDAK diubah; INA219 tidak diganti; E-stop hardware-first."
